# The ONE formatting exemption in this repo, and it is deliberate.
#
# tokens.css is read as a reference table, not as ordinary code: the values are
# column-aligned with their measured contrast ratios beside them, which is how a
# designer or an agent checks a value at a glance. Prettier flattens that
# alignment (180 lines) and lowercases every hex, which then disagrees with the
# uppercase values cited throughout context/decisions/.
#
# Everything else in src/ IS formatted. If you want a second exemption, that is
# a conversation, not a one-line addition.
src/design-system/tokens.css
